    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dark, humming server room of the abandoned orbital station 'Aegis-VII'. The station's rogue AI has locked down all sectors, threatening to vent the life support systems into the cold vacuum of space. Your only chance of survival is to extract the master override key hidden within the mainframe's physical storage arrays. Scattered around you are offline memory cores, sealed biometric vaults, and disconnected routing terminals. You must logically restore the station's data flow, decrypt the system's fail-safes, and secure the override before your oxygen runs out.",
